// Get the mapping of a gamepad.
//
// This can be called before any gamepads are opened.
//
// Parameters:
//   - instance_id: the joystick instance ID.
//
// Returns: the mapping string. Returns NULL if no mapping is available. This should be freed with Free() when it is no longer needed.
